 with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  28 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 12 12 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  Inked and sectioned to reveal a 0 6cm diameter firm ill defined mass located 0 2cm from the closest inked margin  The specimen is submitted entirely in A G  with the nodule in A and B  Resident  TAN A  INCE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST   A REMOVED_DATE CM IN DIAMETER FIRM NODULE  TO SMALL TO FREEZE   O R  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , NOS.
